  "Recover supplies on the Moon. Extract successfully to bring them home.": "在月球回收物资，成功撤离后带回飞船。",
  "Locate supply caches and navigate back to the extraction beacon. Additional regions are not charted for deployment.": "寻找补给箱并返回撤离信标。其他区域尚未开放出战。",
  "Your ship needs recovered materials. Search the lunar caches, manage your limited cargo space and make it back to the extraction zone.": "飞船需要回收材料。搜寻月球补给箱，合理利用有限的随身空间，并返回撤离区域。",
  "Your equipment is taken from the character loadout. Check your halo weapons and carried supplies before deployment.": "出战使用角色页中的装备。出发前请检查光环武器与随身补给。",
  "Your session host determines the map and mission timing. Connection setup follows the readiness check.": "会话主持者决定地图与行动时限。完成准备检查后设置连接。",
  "Host a session or join an existing crew in the connection terminal. Selected cells are taken from storage; unused cells return only after extraction.": "在连接终端主持行动或加入小队。选中的电池从仓库取出，剩余能源仅在成功撤离后返还。",
  "Cells leave storage when the server accepts deployment. [R] spends battery energy for missing rounds, according to the weapon's energy cost. Unspent charge stays in the cell.": "服务器确认出战后，电池离开仓库。按 R 依照武器消耗补充弹药，未消耗的能源保留在电池中。",
  "Carried supplies are lost on death or timeout. Storage is credited after a successful server settlement. The session controls the extraction countdown.": "死亡或超时将失去随身物资。服务器结算成功后入库，撤离倒计时由服务器控制。",
